			"Message": "chore(Output): Add commit message reference file\n\nCreate commit_message.json documenting the build(Output) commit that removed compiled Configuration artifacts and normalized Source formatting. This file captures the commit message for the change that deleted generated ESBuild outputs (.js/.js.map) from Configuration/ while retaining and reformatting authoritative Source/ modules (Source/ESBuild/Output.js and tsconfig.json).\n\nThe reference file preserves the commit narrative for traceability in the Output component's history.",
			"SHA": "3e869c7cc21b46d0cfcce970484838cf462011cc"
		},
